Still 1.2.0. The pocket panel does less, and says more.

It can be pulled down to a handle and stays down until you pull it back up. While the microphone is open, a bar counts the silence down — "12 s until the microphone closes" — and while it is closed the same spot says to tap three times, so the panel never changes height under your thumb.

With no headset connected it now explains why pocket mode is pointless instead of offering it, and leaves the microphone open.
